browser and can change their own password.  First start without users (way
A): /api/setup sets the admin password and the name.
Frontend: /usr/share/untrash/desk (index.html, desk.js), design /ut/.

Test mode (ZT_DESK_TEST=1, os/image/tests/test-desk-host.py): system
commands are only logged, all paths under ZT_DESK_ROOT.
"""
